{title: Jaadu Bhari Aankhon Wali Suno}
{artist: Dastak Udit Narayan Rajesh Roshan}
{key: D#}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#]Mujhko Jab Aise Dekh [G#]ti Ho Tum,        [A#]Rang Bhar Jate Hain [D#]Fizaon Men
[D#]Kasmasati Hai Aar [G#]zu Dil Men,        [A#]Geet Ghul Jaate Hain [D#]Hawaon Men
[D#]Jadoo Bhari Aankhon Wali Suno,        Tum [A#]Aise Mujhe De [G#]kha Na [D#]Karo
Phir [A#]Main Koi [D#]Umid Karun,        Phir [F]Mujhko Koi [D#]Araman Ho
Tum [A#]Shayad Meri [D#]Ban Jao,        Phir [F]Dil Ko Aisa [D#]Gumaan Ho
[D#]Par Aisa Na Ho [A#]Achchha [D#]Hai,        [D#]In Baaton Men Kya [A#]Rakha [D#]Hai
Mujh [F]ko Aisi Um [A#]mid Na [D#]Do,        [D#]Jadoo Bhari Aankhon Wali Suno
Tum [A#]Aise Mujhe De [G#]kha Na [D#]Karo,        Phir [A#]Dhadakan Me Tum [D#]Bas Jao
Phir [F]Koi Gazal Main [D#]Gaun,        Phir [A#]Chand Men Tumko [D#]Main Dekhun
Phoo [F]lon Men Tumko [D#]Paun,        [D#]Par Aisa Na Ho [A#]Achchha [D#]Hai
Is [D#]kaa Anjam To [A#]Hota [D#]Hai,        Vo [F]Dard Hi Deta [A#]Hai Dil [D#]Ko
